\section{Symbolic Execution Engine Design}\label{sec:symexec-engine}

\subsection{Architecture Overview}\label{sec:symexec-arch}

A symbolic execution engine consists of several interacting components, each
responsible for a distinct aspect of the analysis.  The architecture of a
typical engine is shown in \cref{fig:symexec-arch}.

